#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomRuntimeBootstrapPlatform.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Extend the canonical runtime target with Framework-owned dependency
#   injection, scoped service graphs, conditional auto-configuration and
#   reusable application starters.
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
#   Existing UmiServiceRegistry, application feature packs, launcher and runtime
#   services remain authoritative. This platform adds orchestration metadata and
#   planning without creating an application-owned container or service locator.
#
# AUTHOR AND ORGANISATION:
#   Sammy Hegab
#   Umicom Foundation
#
# LICENCE:
#   MIT
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
